{"id":359,"date":"2019-12-24T12:14:43","date_gmt":"2019-12-24T11:14:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/strasbourgcarrelage.com\/?page_id=359"},"modified":"2020-03-31T15:11:44","modified_gmt":"2020-03-31T13:11:44","slug":"style-industriel","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/styles\/style-industriel\/","title":{"rendered":"Style industriel"},"content":{"rendered":"<section id=\"title-two-columns-block_5e0dfebb2d33c\" class=\"title-two-columns-block\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        \n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vous cherchez \u00e0 rendre votre d\u00e9coration int\u00e9rieure<\/span><b> tendance<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> et <\/span><b>apaisante<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">?<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Le style de d\u00e9co industriel repose sur la<\/span><b> sobri\u00e9t\u00e9, <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">l\u2019utilisation de<\/span><b> mat\u00e9riaux bruts<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> et les \u00e9l\u00e9ments emprunt\u00e9s au <\/span><b>monde ouvrier du d\u00e9but du si\u00e8cle<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">En effet, ce style de d\u00e9coration int\u00e9rieure comprend g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement l\u2019utilisation de <\/span><b>machinerie m\u00e9tallique<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> apparente (tuyaux, suspensions de lumi\u00e8res, etc&#8230;). Les <\/span><b>meubles de r\u00e9cup\u00e9ration<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, tels qu\u2019on pouvait en trouver dans les usines d&rsquo;antan se marient \u00e9galement parfaitement au style industriel.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Le carrelage utilis\u00e9 pour un style industriel peut \u00eatre compos\u00e9 de <\/span><b>mat\u00e9riaux bruts<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, en particulier le <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/imitations\/imitation-beton\/\"><b>carrelage imitation b\u00e9ton<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Le carrelage style industriel peut \u00eatre install\u00e9 au sol, mais aussi sur les murs ou m\u00eame \u00e0 l\u2019ext\u00e9rieur.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Strasbourg Carrelage est une entreprise familiale qui vous \u00e9paule dans vos projets de d\u00e9co \u00e0 Strasbourg depuis plus de 17 ans. <\/span>Nous avons d\u00e9j\u00e0 pos\u00e9<b> plus d\u2019un millions de m\u00e8tres carr\u00e9s de carrelage<\/b> dans le Grand Est<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nous sommes dispos\u00e9 \u00e0 vous accueillir dans notre showroom situ\u00e9 dans le Bas-Rhin, o\u00f9 nous vous proposerons\u00a0une<b> large gamme de carrelage<\/b>.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Forts de notre exp\u00e9rience, nous sommes en mesure de <\/span><b>comprendre vos besoins <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">afin de donner vie \u00e0 vos projets d\u00e9co.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nous vous attendons pour vous pr\u00e9senter tous nos carrelages adapt\u00e9s \u00e0 votre nouvelle <\/span><b>d\u00e9coration style industriel<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section id=\"red-content-block_5e0dff882d33d\" class=\"red-content-block simple\" style=\"background-color: #8b0936\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n            \n                            <h3 class=\"big-title\"><span><p>Int\u00e9ress\u00e9(e) par l\u2019un de ces mod\u00e8les ?<\/p>\n<\/span><\/h3>\n            \n                            <div class=\"text\">\n                    <p>Vous recherchez un style particulier ? Vous souhaitez voir d\u2019autres carrelages de ce genre ?<br \/>\nContactez-nous, nous vous proposerons d\u2019autres produits, au meilleur prix !<\/p>\n\n                <\/div>\n            \n            \n                                                <p class=\"text-center\">\n                                        <a class=\"btn btn-outline-white\" href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/contact\/\" title=\"Contactez-nous\">Contactez-nous<\/a>\n                            \n                    <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>D\u00e9couvrez notre collection carrelage style industriel, pour donner un aspect tendance et sobre \u00e0 votre int\u00e9rieur, tout en b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiant des avantages qu\u2019offre le carrelage.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":360,"parent":216,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-359","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/359","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=359"}],"version-history":[{"count":14,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/359\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":979,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/359\/revisions\/979"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/216"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/360"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=359"}],"curies":[{"name